// The Uzer hunter area's desert devil tracking ground, read off the imported map (m53_48): every cactus,
// rockslide and burrow a trail can pass through - 474's tracking nodes 19388-19402 and burrows 19552/19553,
// by the coord of their south-west tile - and every patch of disturbed sand (474's 19430) a devil can be
// hiding in. A coord here with no node on it is a trail step nobody can inspect: the live battery checks.

